{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45216","headline":"同杨使君白苹洲送陆侍御士佳入朝 · 皎然","name":"同杨使君白苹洲送陆侍御士佳入朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"久爱吴兴客，来依道德藩。\n旋师闻杕杜，归路忆轘辕。\n旧佩苍玉在，新歌白芷繁。\n今朝天地静，北望重飞翻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45216.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45216","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}